# Source images dropped in the repo root: originals for logos, share cards and
# the portrait. Nothing in the root is served, so the build never needs them.
# The leading slash anchors this to the root only, so the processed files under
# public/ stay tracked. Those MUST be committed or the deployed site 404s them.
